# Planning documentation triad

| Document | Role |
|----------|------|
| `docs/SPECIFICATIONS.md` | Behavior contract **today** |
| `ROADMAP.md` | Planned work, global item IDs |
| `CHANGELOG.md` | What **shipped** per release (Keep a Changelog) |

**README.md** is user-facing; **SPEC** is the testable contract.

## When shipping work

1. Implement against **SPEC** (update SPEC if behavior changes).
2. Mark roadmap item **Done (vX.Y.Z)** in `ROADMAP.md`.
3. Add **CHANGELOG** bullets under `[Unreleased]`.
4. Sync **VERSION** and run **`make release-check`** before tag (when remote exists).
